# Fail closed: only reviewed project files may be added to Git.
# Session JSON, MAC inventories, local scripts, binaries, and future local
# artifacts stay ignored. Review new files before adding an exception.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/AGENTS.md
!/README.md
!/go.mod
!/go.sum
!/main.go
!/main_test.go
!/portal.go
!/portal_test.go
!/scan.go
!/scan_test.go
!/scan_darwin.go
!/scan_darwin_test.go
!/scan_linux.go
!/scan_linux_test.go
